            <div xml:id="d999">

                <pb facs="1016" n="896" xml:id="pg896"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Leishman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-10-26"><hi rendition="#italic">October 26,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Root acknowledges receipt of Mr. Leishman’s telegram of the 26th instant
                    concerning the second conviction of the two naturalized Americans and advises
                    him that an instruction was sent to him on Friday last, making friendly
                    overtures for the adjustment of the naturalization and jurisdictional questions.
                    If the Ottoman Government should carry out its intention to execute the sentence
                    immediately upon one of the prisoners it would be impracticable for this
                    government to take the initiative toward a result so greatly to be desired, and
                    the uncompromising attitude of Turkey would have to be referred to Congress for
                    such treatment as that body may deem appropriate. Instructs him to urge that the
                    original proposition for a stay of proceedings in these cases pending mutual
                    agreement be accepted. It is most desirable that Mr. Leishman should take action
                    before the Turkish Government by precipitate action may make an agreement
                    impossible and raise an issue between the two governments which may be most
                    difficult of adjustment.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
